    "proof": "Prefix lifts satisfy u_k=u0+2*3^m*k. After dividing 3u_k+1 by two, its dependence on k has an odd coefficient. Modulo 2^a, exact valuation a is therefore one affine congruence with one solution. Applying one more accelerated step gives C'=3C+2^S. For the no-go solve 3u+1=0 mod 2^q. The two lifts modulo 2^(q+1) split: one has quotient odd and exact valuation q, while the other is still divisible by 2^(q+1).",
